  "blurb": "A modern four-bedroom pool villa set high in the hills above Bophut, with sweeping sea views and a bright, open plan of sliding glass that blurs the line between indoor and outdoor living. A quiet, green setting a short drive from the beach, restaurants and Fisherman's Village, with a private pool, high-speed fibre WiFi and free on-site parking.",
  "detail": "Set high in the hills above Bophut on Koh Samui's north coast, this modern four-bedroom villa is built around a private pool and a bright, open-plan living space where large sliding glass doors dissolve the boundary between indoors and out. The setting is quiet and green, with sea views over the treetops, yet it's still a short drive down to the beach, restaurants and the shops and cafés of Fisherman's Village.\n\nFour en-suite bedrooms are spread across the villa, each finished with warm timber accents, and the open living room centres on a comfortable lounge with a smart TV alongside a fully equipped kitchen. Outdoor salas and a private pool terrace make the most of the hillside position, and free parking is available on site.\n\nThe access road up to the villa is steep, so guests should be comfortable with that before booking — it's easiest reached by scooter or car rather than on foot, and a 4WD or careful driving is recommended. High-speed fibre WiFi runs throughout, and the villa comes with weekly cleaning on stays of seven nights or longer, plus regular pool cleaning and maintenance.\n\nElectricity and water are metered: the nightly rate includes an allowance of 100 kWh of electricity and THB 1,000 of water per stay, with usage beyond that billed at THB 8 per kWh and THB 1,000 per stay respectively (plus 7% VAT), and meters checked at check-in and check-out. Airport transfers can be arranged at THB 900 per car each way, and a baby cot, high chair or extra bed can be added on request for a small additional charge.",
